    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63794" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχό-ομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγχη</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be furnished with a point</i>
			or <i>head</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελογχωμένον δόρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1111a13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόντιον -ωμένον σιδήρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.5.1
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be ornamented with</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγχαι, στολὴ χρυσῷ λελογχωμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Mag.</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
